Description:
 niaos-root-preparation - Internal NiaOS root preparation service
Changes:
 niaos-root-preparation (0.6.0) trixie; urgency=medium
 .
   * Add root-supervisor sessions for first-use dedicated bank preparation.
   * Retain bank reservation through readonly observation and explicit release.
   * Reduce child capabilities and seal storage after controller service stop.
   * Isolate failure sealing from the controller cgroup.
